  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3006.13 Use of ERCs by Utilities. The use of ERCs by a utility as defined in RSA 362:2 shall be subject to such additional conditions as ordered pursuant to applicable law by the public utilities commission.\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
